# AquaWatch Environment Variables Configuration

# Optional: MapTiler API Key (Free tier at https://cloud.maptiler.com)
# When provided, AquaWatch can use high-resolution MapTiler Dataviz dark tiles.
# When omitted, AquaWatch automatically uses OpenStreetMap's direct tile server
# with CSS dark-theme filtering (requires zero keys or signup).
# VITE_MAPTILER_KEY=your_maptiler_api_key_here

# Optional: Webhook URL for Telegram or Email incident dispatch
# VITE_ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL=https://example.com/api/water-alerts
